{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>לבעליו</b> — Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other two: ישלם לבעליו (in the passage of a paid watchman), and עושר שמור לבעליו לרעתו — for this one, because of his wealth he dug a pit in the public domain, and it is לרעתו (to his detriment) in that it obligates him to pay for its damage. Just as we derive here ישיב — even bran; so too in the passage of a paid watchman we say: even bran."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:58.296010177Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}